{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>Let it be directed</b>. Incense — the letter kaf is lacking, as in כקטורת לפניך (like incense before You), similarly: ונשלמה פרים שפתינו (and let the offering of our lips fulfill [the role of] bulls), and likewise מנחת ערב (the evening meal-offering), for the incense is in the morning."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 141, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:42:25.195126930Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}